# =============================================================================
# AgentTower — Git Ignore Rules
# 严禁将运行态面板交流数据、Worktree、测试沙盒、日志、凭据与临时备份提交进 Git
# =============================================================================

# 1. 项目专属运行时与面板沟通数据仓（对话 SQLite、Worktrees、测试运行沙盒、日志、临时索引）
# >>> agent-tower (managed: ignore runtime state, allow committable project specs)
.agent-tower/*
!.agent-tower/spec/
.agent-tower/spec/*
!.agent-tower/spec/INDEX.md
!.agent-tower/spec/01-business/
!.agent-tower/spec/01-business/**
!.agent-tower/spec/02-coding/
!.agent-tower/spec/02-coding/**
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/
.agent-tower/spec-archive/*
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/INDEX.md
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/manifest.json
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/01-business/
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/01-business/**
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/02-coding/
!.agent-tower/spec-archive/02-coding/**
!.agent-tower/docs/
!.agent-tower/docs/**
# <<< agent-tower
.agent-studio/
worktrees/
test-runs/
sandbox-runs/

# 2. 数据库与流式日志文件（全局兜底拦截）
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# 3. 依赖、测试覆盖率与浏览器自动化缓存
node_modules/
coverage/
.playwright-mcp/
dist/

# 4. 守护进程握手租约、环境变量与敏感凭据
.env*
!.env.example
daemon-lease.json
daemon-spawn.lock
global-settings.json
standalone-launch-*.url
auth.json
*.secret
*.token
secrets.json
tokens.json

# 5. 临时文件、历史备份与系统杂物（防抛屎硬约束）
tmp/
tmp-*
.tmp*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.bak.*
archive-legacy/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.sqlite*
*.log.*
*.bak*
*lease*.json
config.json
cc-switch.db*
